Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 21:11:54 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 25/27] d3d11, winemetal: VR eye-texture export

IMTLD3D11ExportableTexture (private, Texture2D resources) returns the
winemetal handle of the resource's MTLTexture and the immediate
context's shared event and value that cover all work submitted so far
(flushes the context). WMTVRSubmit (unix call 146) hands one frame's
eye textures plus pose/FOV to a remoting executor that has a VR host;
the plain unix side returns STATUS_NOT_SUPPORTED.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
